            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.3.4</h2>

<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li>A "Test connection" button in Settings → Account. It checks whether</li>
</ul>
<p>  your dictation can actually reach our servers on each network route</p>
<p>  and tells you in plain language what's wrong — a blocked upload, an</p>
<p>  expired sign-in, or no credits. It's free: it doesn't transcribe.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
