            <sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.3.3</h2>

<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Dictation on slow or congested networks (reported across Vietnam):</li>
</ul>
<p>  recordings are now uploaded in a compressed format about 5× smaller,</p>
<p>  so the audio reaches the server even where the previous larger upload</p>
<p>  stalled. This is the real fix behind the "Something went wrong" errors</p>
<p>  some users saw after speaking.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
