            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.3.2</h2>

<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The network route check is now featherweight — it pings a 93-byte</li>
</ul>
<p>  health endpoint instead of downloading the full model list, so</p>
<p>  checking your routes uses almost no data.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
